---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import logoBlanco from '../../assets/logo-blanco.webp'

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();

const quickLinks = [
  { name: "Talento y selección estratégica", href: "/talento" },
  { name: "Psicoterapia/Atención Clínica", href: "/psicologia" },
  { name: "Evaluaciones y diagnóstico", href: "/psicologia" },
  { name: "Formación de Equipos", href: "/formacion" },
  { name: "I+D e Innovación", href: "/id" },
];

const legalLinks = [
  { name: "Políticas de Privacidad", href: "/privacidad" },
  { name: "Términos y Condiciones", href: "/terminos" }
];

const instaTalento =
  "https://www.instagram.com/maticesconsultora.talento"
const instaPsico =
  "https://www.instagram.com/maticesconsultora.psicologia/"
const linkedinUrl =
  "https://www.linkedin.com/in/maticesconsultoria-talento-y-psicologia/"
---

<footer class="w-full bg-verde-bosque text-crema-calido/90 pt-16 pb-0 border-t border-verde-bosque/20">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 lg:gap-8">
    
    <!-- Col 1: Brand -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group focus:outline-none">
        <Image
          src={logoBlanco}
          alt="Logo Matices"
          class="h-9 w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
        />
      </a>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-crema-calido/75 max-w-xs">
        Encontramos el equilibrio perfecto entre el talento humano y la precisión técnica estratégica de tu organización.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 2: Services -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-crema-calido">Áreas de Especialidad</h3>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        {quickLinks.map(link => (
          <li>
            <a href={link.href} class="font-sans text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors text-crema-calido/80">
              {link.name}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 3: Contact -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-crema-calido">Contacto Corporativo</h3>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-sans text-sm text-crema-calido/80">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-verde-lima mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75" />
          </svg>
          <a href="mailto:contacto@maticesconsultora.cl" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">
            contacto@maticesconsultora.cl
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-verde-lima mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Reñaca Norte 25 Of 1207 <br />Viña del Mar - Chile</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href={instaTalento}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="social-link flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            <svg
              class="social-icon h-5 w-5 text-verde-lima flex-shrink-0"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5" />
              <path
                d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1
                   12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"
              />
              <line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5" />
            </svg>
            <span>Matices Talento</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href={instaPsico}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="social-link flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            <svg
              class="social-icon h-5 w-5 text-verde-lima flex-shrink-0"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5" />
              <path
                d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1
                   12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"
              />
              <line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5" />
            </svg>
            <span>Matices Psicología</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href={linkedinUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="social-link flex items-center gap-3 hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            <svg
              class="social-icon h-5 w-5 text-verde-lima flex-shrink-0"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2
                   2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"
              />
              <rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9" />
              <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2" />
            </svg>
            <span>Matices Linkedin</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 4: Newsletter / Quick CTA -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-crema-calido">Alianzas Estratégicas</h3>
      <p class="font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-crema-calido/75">
        ¿Interesado en diseñar una solución de capital humano a tu medida? Agenda una sesión consultiva inicial sin costo.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="/contacto" 
        class="bg-verde-lima text-white font-sans text-center font-semibold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 active:scale-95 transition-all text-sm block"
      >
        Iniciar Diagnóstico
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Divider & Sub-Footer -->
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-16 mt-16 pt-8 pb-12 border-t border-crema-calido/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
    <p class="font-sans text-xs text-crema-calido/60 text-center md:text-left">
      &copy; {currentYear} Matices Consultoría Integral. Todos los derechos reservados.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6">
      {legalLinks.map(link => (
        <a href={link.href} class="font-sans text-xs hover:text-white transition-colors text-crema-calido/60">
          {link.name}
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Thin Credit Bar -->
  <div class="w-full bg-[#5A7FA3] py-2 text-center text-xs text-crema-calido font-sans border-t border-[#5A7FA3]/10">
    <p class="opacity-95 tracking-wide">
      Sitio diseñado y desarrollado por: <a href="https://gabrielzavando.cl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">Gabriel Zavando</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .social-link:hover .social-icon {
    transform: scale3d(1.1, 1.1, 1);
  }
  .social-icon {
    transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    will-change: transform;
  }
</style>
